readme.text:
Two sources describe one workspace, in increasing precedence:

1. `<DSH_HOME>/workspace-switch.json`, whose `workspaces` map is keyed by
   workspace directory;
2. `<workspace>/.dsh/workspace-switch.json`, which replaces the shared entry
   for that workspace when it exists.

```json
{
  "workspaces": {
    "E:\\my_project\\godot-game": {
      "plugins": { "mcp-godot-ai": { "enabled": false, "tools": ["mcp__godot-ai__run"] } },
